<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia May car registrations fell 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia May car registrations fell 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations fell a seasonally adjusted 0.7 percent in May to 55,355, the Australian Bureau of Statistics reported on Friday.</p>
<p>Economists had expected a rise of around 1.5 percent for May.</p>
</text>
